00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.623
And they threaten a smaller objective.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.458
They kill or capture people.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.661
They cause movement of the enemy

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.629
